OL,3,GNEWSATeam England athlete teaches the
OL,4,Aart of falling over
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Team England athlete has been leading
OL,7,Fa judo session in Lichfield, teaching
OL,8,Fpeople with mobility issues the art of
OL,9,Ffalling over safely.
OL,11,FJudo champion Kelly Petersen-Pollard
OL,12,Fhosted a class at MoveMojo's Centre in
OL,13,FLichfield, Staffordshire, on Tuesday.
OL,15,FAbout a third of people aged 65 and
OL,16,Fover, and about half of people aged 80
OL,17,Fand over, fall at least once per year,
OL,18,Faccording to the National Institute for
OL,19,FHealth and Care Excellence (NICE).
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
