OL,3,GNEWSATeam England athlete teaches the
OL,4,Aart of falling over
OL,5,
OL,6,FPetersen-Pollard, from Birmingham,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We're basically going around and
OL,8,Fteaching people to fall so that when
OL,9,Ffalls do happen, you can land a lot
OL,10,Fbetter to prevent injuries - especially
OL,11,Fwhen you're getting older and stuff
OL,12,Flike that."
